      "raw_text": "NADIA RAHMAN\nFull Stack Developer\nMirpur 10, Dhaka, Bangladesh | +880 1712-345678 | nadia.rahman.dev@example.com\nlinkedin.com/in/nadia-rahman-dev | github.com/nadiarahman | nadiarahman.vercel.app\n\nPROFESSIONAL SUMMARY\nFull stack developer with 3+ years of experience building REST APIs and dashboards with Node.js, Express and React. Comfortable with PostgreSQL, Docker and CI/CD pipelines.\n\nWORK EXPERIENCE\nSoftware Engineer | Brain Station 23 Ltd | Jan 2023 – Present\n• Built microservices in Node.js and Express serving 50k daily users\n• Migrated reporting from MySQL to PostgreSQL and cut query time by 40%\n• Set up GitHub Actions CI/CD and Docker based deployments\n\nJunior Web Developer\nPathao Limited, Dhaka\nJune 2021 - Dec 2022\n• Developed React dashboards for the rider operations team\n• Wrote unit tests with Jest\n\nFreelance Web Developer — Upwork\nMar 2020 – May 2021\n• Delivered 15+ client websites using HTML, CSS, JavaScript and Firebase\n\nEDUCATION\nB.Sc. in Computer Science and Engineering\nBRAC University, Dhaka | 2016 – 2020\nCGPA: 3.62 / 4.00\n\nHSC (Science Group), Notre Dame College, 2016, GPA 5.00\n\nSKILLS\nLanguages: JavaScript, TypeScript, Python, SQL\nFrameworks: Node.js, Express, React, Next.js, Tailwind CSS\nTools: Docker, Git, AWS, Postman, Jira\nOther: Agile, Problem Solving, Team Leadership\n\nPROJECTS\n• HireBoard – Kanban based job tracker built with React and Express\n• ShopBD – E-commerce API with JWT auth and MongoDB\n\nCERTIFICATIONS\n• AWS Certified Cloud Practitioner (2023)\n• Meta Front-End Developer Certificate\n\nLANGUAGES\nBengali (Native), English (Fluent)\n\nPERSONAL INFORMATION\nFather's Name: Abdul Rahman\nDate of Birth: 12 March 1998\nReligion: Islam\nMarital Status: Single"
